        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2392803?u=f87fd80308b2e93da1b3c05338d3968b320abaa1&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The assignment check used a <code class=\"notranslate\">const</code> variable. Changed to one that used <code class=\"notranslate\">let</code></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Low hanging 🥭</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/MDN/Community/Open_source_etiquette\" rel=\"nofollow\">I want to publicly demonstrate my own skills to improve my chances of getting a job.</a></li>\n</ol>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Thanks <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/Goal-max/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/Goal-max\">@Goal-max</a> for reporting</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #39332.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3030277697\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/39332\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/39332/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/39332\">#39332</a></p>",
